  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assignment of consultant as member of OBN (Open Broadcast Network) board of directors. OBN was founded in 1996 to create an independent television network. The Swedish journalist Ingemar Olander will be assigned as member of the board for 1999.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida upphandlar journalisten Ingemar Olander/AB Hertur att p&#xe5; OBNs (Open Broadcast Network) uppdrag som svensk representant ing&#xe5; i OBNs styrelse under 1999. OBN bildades 1996 f&#xf6;r att skapa ett n&#xe4;tverk av oberoende TV-stationer i Bosnien.</narrative>
  </description>
